Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,This warship is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:01.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,being {\c&H0040D8FF&}lifted{\c&HFFFFFF&} out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.85,0:00:02.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the sea…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:03.79,CapHi,,0,0,0,,…by {\c&H0040D8FF&}one{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H0040D8FF&}old{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.79,0:00:04.10,CapHi,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}man.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:05.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rome had sent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.43,0:00:06.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}sixty{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H0040D8FF&}warships{\c&HFFFFFF&} to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,take the city
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:08.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,of Syracuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,But {\c&H0040D8FF&}Syracuse{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,had {\c&H0040D8FF&}Archimedes —{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:11.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,a mathematician
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,in his seventies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:13.33,CapHi,,0,0,0,,And he {\c&H0040D8FF&}wasn't{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:13.78,CapHi,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}worried.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:15.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Romans rowed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:16.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,right up under
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:16.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,the walls…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.78,0:00:17.98,CapHi,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}…exactly{\c&HFFFFFF&} where he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:18.63,CapHi,,0,0,0,,wanted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:19.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then a {\c&H0040D8FF&}giant{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:21.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}wooden{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H0040D8FF&}arm{\c&HFFFFFF&} swung
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,out over the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:22.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:24.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,An {\c&H0040D8FF&}iron{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H0040D8FF&}claw{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:24.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,dropped…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:25.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,…and {\c&H0040D8FF&}bit{\c&HFFFFFF&} into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:25.92,CapHi,,0,0,0,,the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:27.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,And it began
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:27.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,to {\c&H0040D8FF&}pull.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:28.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}Up.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:29.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}Up.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:30.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:30.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:32.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,the {\c&H0040D8FF&}claw{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H0040D8FF&}released{\c&HFFFFFF&} it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:36.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,even a {\c&H0040D8FF&}rope{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:38.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,hanging over the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:39.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,wall made Roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:40.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,soldiers {\c&H0040D8FF&}panic.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:42.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rome had {\c&H0040D8FF&}sixty{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:42.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,warships.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:45.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0040D8FF&}Syracuse{\c&HFFFFFF&} had {\c&H0040D8FF&}Archimedes.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
